encoding  utf-8
survey Grebe2026

centreline
# The dig at the end of the parallel passage, back towards the junction chamber (which then
# takes a dog leg off towards Predition), surveyed with a DistoX and SexyTopo on 14 November 2026.
# Station 1 is the end of the dig; 25 is the tie into the existing survey, equated with 208@G4
# in Grebe.th. Each leg is SexyTopo's average of its repeated shots (3 each);
# the splays are as shot. Exported from SexyTopo (grebe.data.json).

date 2026.11.14

instrument  instruments "DistoX, SexyTopo"

data normal from to tape compass clino ignoreall
